# Line endings are LF in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# Section 6 of the MVP runtime contract fixes byte-exact comparison with no
# normalization, so a fixture whose line ending depends on the platform that
# checked it out is not the same input everywhere. Pinning this also stops the
# class of local-only test failure where a checker parses a file that CI sees
# with different bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
